@base = http://127.0.0.1:18102
@key = local-adyen-key
@admin = local-admin-key

### Configure two transient processing failures, then normal account rules
PUT {{base}}/__sim/scenarios/adyen-lesson-001
X-Simulator-Admin-Key: {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"transientFailures":2,"loseResponse":false,"delayMs":1000}

### Accept for background authorisation
POST {{base}}/v72/payments
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Idempotency-Key: adyen-lesson-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"merchantAccount":"merchant-demo","reference":"adyen-lesson-001","amount":{"value":2500,"currency":"EUR"},"paymentMethod":{"type":"scheme","storedPaymentMethodId":"pm_funded"}}

> {% client.global.set("adyenId", response.body.pspReference); %}

### LOCAL inspection: attempts, nextAttemptAt and eventual AUTHORISED
GET {{base}}/__sim/payments/{{adyenId}}
X-Simulator-Admin-Key: {{admin}}

### After AUTHORISED, request the full capture (separate capture reference)
POST {{base}}/v72/payments/{{adyenId}}/captures
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Idempotency-Key: adyen-capture-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"merchantAccount":"merchant-demo","reference":"adyen-capture-001","amount":{"value":2500,"currency":"EUR"}}

### Inspect the durable outgoing events; no receiver is required for inspection
GET {{base}}/__sim/payments/{{adyenId}}/webhooks
X-Simulator-Admin-Key: {{admin}}

### Check one reserve and one capture after the worker completes
GET {{base}}/__sim/payments/{{adyenId}}/ledger
X-Simulator-Admin-Key: {{admin}}
